{"applicability_conditions":"适用于将分解切应力分解为胞内贡献（c）与胞壁贡献（w）、并通过混合律合成的位错密度（cell interior/cell wall）描述框架。","identity":{"block_id":"b0054","equation_id":"equation_010","equation_number":"10","is_image":false,"latex_hint":"$$\n\\sigma_ {\\mathrm{ext}} = M \\tau_ {\\mathrm{rss}} = M \\left(f _ {\\mathrm{c}} \\tau_ {\\mathrm{eff,c}} + f _ {\\mathrm{w}} \\tau_ {\\mathrm{eff,w}}\\right)\\tag{10}\n$$","paper_id":"10.1007_s11837-014-1032-x"},"latex":"\\sigma_{\\mathrm{ext}} = M \\tau_{\\mathrm{rss}} = M \\left(f_{\\mathrm{c}} \\tau_{\\mathrm{eff,c}} + f_{\\mathrm{w}} \\tau_{\\mathrm{eff,w}}\\right)","purpose":"将外部应力与平均分解切应力联系起来，并通过混合律（加权平均）把胞内（cell interior）和胞壁（cell wall）的分解切应力合成为平均分解切应力。","symbols":[{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"外部（外加）应力","symbol":"\\sigma_{\\mathrm{ext}}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"Taylor 因子（外部应力与平均分解切应力之间的换算因子）","symbol":"M","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"平均分解切应力（由胞内与胞壁分解切应力经混合律合成）","symbol":"\\tau_{\\mathrm{rss}}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"胞内（cell interior）在混合律中的权重/分数","symbol":"f_{\\mathrm{c}}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"胞内（cell interior）的分解切应力","symbol":"\\tau_{\\mathrm{eff,c}}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"胞壁（cell wall）在混合律中的权重/分数","symbol":"f_{\\mathrm{w}}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"胞壁（cell wall）的分解切应力","symbol":"\\tau_{\\mathrm{eff,w}}","unit":null,"value":null}],"unmapped":["τ_rss 随后用于 Eqs. 24 和 26 中计算孪晶形核概率。","对于胞壁，ρ_x = ρ_w + ρ_d（即胞壁位错密度包含胞壁位错与沉积位错）。"]}